WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:08.668
Autograde turns existing PLC and SCADA telemetry into consistent batch evidence at a cost suited to high-volume products.

2
00:00:08.618 --> 00:00:18.904
It checks boundaries, factors, allocation and meter coverage under one versioned method, then creates a commitment and a QR-ready verification link.

3
00:00:18.904 --> 00:00:22.641
This is controlled automation, not automatic approval.

4
00:00:22.641 --> 00:00:30.284
Missing intervals, outdated calibration or unapproved factors lead to abstention, and no label is issued.

5
00:00:30.284 --> 00:00:34.555
Human reviewers still examine sampled records and exceptions.

6
00:00:34.555 --> 00:00:38.904
The result is affordable, repeatable evidence with clear limits.
